  "releaseNotes": "* Re-added NTLM to the list of mechanisms to try by default. (issue #1953)\n* Fixed IMAP to treat '+' as a normal Atom token. (issue #1956)\n* Added fallback logic for imap.strato.de if LIST doesn't return the INBOX. (issue #1957)",
  "repository": "",
